Description: Clean audio and video on your own computer
 Safa cuts silence, removes noise, levels loudness, separates voice
 from music and writes subtitles — everything runs locally, nothing
 is uploaded (the app only listens on 127.0.0.1).
 .
 ffmpeg is bundled (tools/ffmpeg) — no Depends on a system ffmpeg, so
 the package installs identically on distros whose ffmpeg is limited
 or missing (e.g. Fedora base repos). The Python runtime and the app
 payload live in /opt/safa; user data (jobs, outputs, models) lives in
 ~/.local/share/safa-data and is never removed on uninstall or purge.
